    "scenesThatPass": [
      "MAGGIE: If there were any bears, they've been bored to death by now.\nJILL: Did you hear that?",
      "MAGGIE: Are you serious? I can feel my arteries clogging just looking at them.\nJILL: For my blood pressure. White ones twice a day, yellow once a day, blue once a week. My sister takes them too, she has trouble with her month…",
      "MAGGIE: You don't just drop your teeth.\nJILL: Actually, one time my sister-",
      "JILL: Oh, yes, would that be okay?\nMAGGIE: Sure it is. We'll bring your mattress and sheets in.",
      "JILL: Thank you, Maggie.\nMAGGIE: You'd do the same for me.\nJILL: Yes, of course I would.\nMAGGIE: Look, I know we've never really been friends or anything..."
    ]
